    "Over October 1\u20133, 2026, the local data shows **2,000 steps per day** if you count all three days, which is the 6,000 steps from October 3 divided by 3.\n\nThe data doesn't match what you remembered, though. Both October 1 and October 2 are recorded as **0 steps**, not just one. The records are flagged \"zero may mean no data,\" so the watch was probably off or not syncing on both days. Only October 3 has a real count, at 6,000 steps.\n\n- **Average of all 3 days:** 2,000 steps/day (counts the zeros, which may understate your activity)\n- **Average of days with data:** 6,000 steps/day (October 3 only)\n\nI'd treat the 6,000 figure as the most reliable number. If you want, I can sync the latest data in case the zeros were a sync gap rather than a watch that was off."
